Despite receiving a <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/06/25/apple-just-increased-prices/">price increase</a> in June, the MacBook Air is currently experiencing a "major" shortage, <a href="https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-08-02/apple-subscriptions-macbook-air-shortages-apple-to-make-glasses-health-device-msbvajjp">according to <em>Bloomberg</em>'s Mark Gurman</a>.<br/>
